s it’s the best thing she’s done all day. It might be."},{"day":56,"min":1060,"text":"You crack the door, say good evening, admit exactly what you are doing. He looks at you a long moment and tells you to be gone by seven. You are gone by six."},{"day":57,"min":430,"text":"Van spot, $18. Morning comes anyway."},{"day":57,"min":430,"text":"Registration and insurance: $70. The week's bills don't care about your card."},{"day":57,"min":430,"text":"You take Send It, for $28. Send 2 dyno lines. It counts from now."},{"day":57,"min":450,"text":"Ramen again. It works."},{"day":57,"min":450,"text":"Gas, $1."},{"day":57,"min":649,"text":"Three hours of oat milk. +$43."},{"day":57,"min":649,"text":"Gas, $30. The van starts on the second try."},{"day":57,"min":649,"text":"Permit, $20. The ranger doesn't look up."},{"day":57,"min":834,"text":"You tell her what it actually costs, including the parts she has not thought about: the cold, the laundry, the being looked at. She listens the whole way through. It is the first useful conversation she has had in a week."},{"day":57,"min":844,"text":"Onsight: Tall Arête, V6, on go 1."},{"day":57,"min":844,"text":"Boulders the size of houses, and you topped one out. The drive home is shorter than the drive out. It always is."},{"day":57,"min":844,"text":"Sent. You did not whoop. You sat at the bottom for a while and let your hands stop shaking. +1 technique."},{"day":57,"min":844,"text":"The local who watched you all season walks over after the send, says nothing for a long while, then tells you what the line is really called: the name that never made it into a guidebook. Then they go back to their own project, and you understand you have been let in on something."},{"day":57,"min":844,"text":"A guidebook author pays $120 for the beta and the photos of the project."},{"day":57,"min":854,"text":"Onsight: Moonstone Mantel, V7, on go 1."},{"day":57,"min":864,"text":"That's no V9. It's soft, and you're not complaining."},{"day":57,"min":864,"text":"Onsight: Hueco Pockets, V9, on go 1."},{"day":57,"min":864,"text":"Crimp Lord. 40 crimp lines sent. Your fingers have seen everything. Fingers comes 10% faster."},{"day":57,"min":864,"text":"Dynamic Precision. Power and technique, both real. Cruxes 5% kinder on dyno lines."},{"day":57,"min":864,"text":"Precision Climber. Fingers and technique, both real. Cruxes 5% kinder on technical lines."},{"day":57,"min":864,"text":"Gas, $30. The van starts on the second try."},{"day":57,"min":1084,"text":"Sage draws a topo in the dirt with a stick and makes you guess the line. You guess wrong. She’s pleased."},{"day":58,"min":430,"text":"Van spot, $18. Morning comes anyway."},{"day":58,"min":450,"text":"Ramen again. It works."},{"day":58,"min":450,"text":"Gas, $1."},{"day":58,"min":638,"text":"Three hours of oat milk. +$43."},{"day":58,"min":638,"text":"Gas, $1."},{"day":58,"min":658,"text":"A wristband, and a look that says the comp wall is not for warming up on."},{"day":58,"min":666,"text":"Onsight: Smear Test, V7, on go 1."},{"day":58,"min":674,"text":"Onsight: Swing Start, V8, on go 1."},{"day":58,"min":682,"text":"Onsight: Compression Box, V9, on go 1."},{"day":58,"min":690,"text":"Onsight: Big Volumes, V10, on go 1."},{"day":58,"min":690,"text":"Gas, $2."},{"day":58,"min":732,"text":"Ramen again. It works."},{"day":58,"min":1020,"text":"You read the same page until it's too dark to read."},{"day":59,"min":430,"text":"Van spot, $18. Morning comes anyway."},{"day":59,"min":450,"text":"Ramen again. It works."},{"day":59,"min":450,"text":"Gas, $1."},{"day":59,"min":638,"text":"Three hours of oat milk. +$43."},{"day":59,"min":638,"text":"Gas, $1."},{"day":59,"min":658,"text":"A wristband, and a look that says the comp wall is not for warming up on."},{"day":59,"min":666,"text":"Repeat: Smear Test, V7, on go 2."},{"day":59,"min":692,"text":"Twice off the jump. There's a pinch halfway you never looked at. New beta: bump through."},{"day":59,"min":738,"text":"Gas, $2."},{"