t Out of Hell, V7, on go 1."},{"day":66,"min":905,"text":"Big Air. 40 dyno lines sent. Committing to the huck is second nature now. Cruxes 4% kinder on a first go."},{"day":66,"min":905,"text":"Gas, $9."},{"day":66,"min":982,"text":"Ramen again. It works."},{"day":66,"min":1020,"text":"You read the same page until it's too dark to read."},{"day":67,"min":430,"text":"Van spot, $18. Morning comes anyway."},{"day":67,"min":430,"text":"The nights are getting cold. Dale at the garage fits heaters, and the gear shop sells propane."},{"day":67,"min":450,"text":"Ramen again. It works."},{"day":67,"min":450,"text":"Gas, $1."},{"day":67,"min":470,"text":"League night: you're in, number 10. 6 problems, V0 to V5; a top counts in its first 5 goes."},{"day":67,"min":478,"text":"Onsight: League 1, V0, on go 1."},{"day":67,"min":486,"text":"Onsight: League 3, V2, on go 1."},{"day":67,"min":494,"text":"Onsight: League 2, V1, on go 1."},{"day":67,"min":502,"text":"Onsight: League 4, V3, on go 1."},{"day":67,"min":502,"text":"League night: 4 tops in 4 goes, 3rd of 10. On the podium, a step down from the top. You can see the top step from here. +8 points, and $15."},{"day":67,"min":502,"text":"Gas, $1."},{"day":67,"min":1020,"text":"You read the same page until it's too dark to read."},{"day":68,"min":440,"text":"Hazel’s driveway. A real bathroom, and coffee in a real mug in the morning."},{"day":68,"min":460,"text":"Ramen again. It works."},{"day":68,"min":460,"text":"Gas, $1."},{"day":68,"min":648,"text":"Three hours of oat milk. +$48."},{"day":68,"min":648,"text":"Gas, $32. The van starts on the second try."},{"day":68,"min":833,"text":"Scout watched the van pull out this morning. He has been doing that lately."},{"day":68,"min":843,"text":"Repeat: Desert Varnish, V7, on go 2."},{"day":68,"min":853,"text":"Sun's on this line now. Everything feels greasy."},{"day":68,"min":853,"text":"Onsight: Powerhouse, V10, on go 1."},{"day":68,"min":853,"text":"Powerhouse Sender. 40 power lines sent. Big moves are just a Tuesday. Power comes 10% faster."},{"day":68,"min":863,"text":"Onsight: The Megaproject, V11, on go 1."},{"day":68,"min":863,"text":"Something clicks. You're climbing V8 now."},{"day":68,"min":863,"text":"Gas, $32. The van starts on the second try."},{"day":68,"min":1063,"text":"Ramen again. It works."},{"day":68,"min":1063,"text":"Scout hops in the van like he's always been yours."},{"day":68,"min":1063,"text":"Ten minutes, one dead battery, one running engine, and a handshake that goes on slightly too long. They ask your name twice so they remember it."},{"day":69,"min":430,"text":"Van spot, $18. Morning comes anyway."},{"day":69,"min":430,"text":"You climb harder than Sage now. She noticed before you did, and she is completely fine about it, which somehow makes it worse."},{"day":69,"min":430,"text":"You've passed Dex. Don't get comfortable."},{"day":69,"min":450,"text":"Ramen again. It works."},{"day":69,"min":450,"text":"Gas, $1."},{"day":69,"min":818,"text":"Six hours on your feet. +$96."},{"day":69,"min":818,"text":"Gas, $8."},{"day":69,"min":873,"text":"A stamp on your hand, and a nod at the steep end."},{"day":69,"min":881,"text":"Repeat: Stalactite, V5, on go 2."},{"day":69,"min":889,"text":"Onsight: Razor Rail, V8, on go 1."},{"day":69,"min":897,"text":"Onsight: Fingertip Cavern, V9, on go 1."},{"day":69,"min":897,"text":"Gas, $9."},{"day":69,"min":959,"text":"He eats like it was a race, and wins."},{"day":69,"min":1020,"text":"You read the same page until it's too dark to read."},{"day":70,"min":430,"text":"Van spot, $18. Morning comes anyway."},{"day":70,"min":450,"text":"Ramen again. It works."},{"day":70,"min":450,"text":"Gas, $1."},{"day":70,"min":464,"text":"You crush half of it into the bag before you reach the door."},{"day":70,"min":828,"text":"Six hours on your feet. +$96."},{"day":70,"min":828,"text":"Gas, $8."},{"day":70,"min":883,"text":"A stamp on your hand, and a nod at the steep end."},{"day":70,"min":891,"text":"